OL,3,GNEWSARiver car teens most likely
OL,4,Adrowned, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree teenagers who died when the car
OL,7,Fthey were in plunged into a river most
OL,8,Flikely drowned, a coroner has heard.
OL,10,FJackson Duke, 17, and 16-year-olds Luke
OL,11,FEtheridge and Zara Shaw died when a
OL,12,Fblack Audi A3 entered the River Wear in
OL,13,FSunderland, just before 13:30 BST on 29
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FA 17-year-old boy, who managed to reach
OL,17,Fsafety, has been released on bail
OL,18,Fpending further inquiries after being
OL,19,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,20,Fby dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
